 "76561198082069478", "personaname": "Cryptic Ghost", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198082069478/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 32760, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2401, "last_played": 1764633866, "avatar": "d4371bdba4c8c3484bc5b88edc6ee3c15d2bc250"}, "language": "english", "review": "\"I'll play a quick match. Shouldn't take too long.\" 100+ minutes in the game, and still going, extremely powerful but still wanting more power.  \n\nRisk of Rain 2 is definitely the best game I have played so far this year.  Looking forward to seeing what new items and characters they add in the months to come. :)\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1559343803, "timestamp_updated": 1559343803, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50982018", "author": {"steamid": "76561198165380368", "personaname": "Eugene The Unseen", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/HavlongRusGamer/", "num_games_owned": 109, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 10688, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 204, "last_played": 1706194860, "avatar": "d1254aba245885da6d85edb3a8c2a3aad947f767"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best game ever. What else do you need to hear. I never was a big fan of roguelike content but this game has another point of view on all that is happening in game industry. It is pleasure to play time after time trying various items. And also I like music very much. Big thanks to Hopoo Games. I'm excited for the progress of this game. Voted for the Game of the Year btw", "timestamp_created": 1559341652, "timestamp_updated": 1606550921, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50981622", "author": {"steamid": "76561197986770456", "personaname": "Mike", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197986770456/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 3357, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1849, "last_played": 1716447848, "avatar": "801303aca074d7b21bb6c6b2bf4a17af456b7e0c"}, "language": "english", "review": "I was skeptical as to how well \"risk of rain\" would work in a 3d environment.  Watching the video's still had me on the fence... but I liked \"risk of rain,\" so I figured I'd give it a try.\n\n\"Risk of Rain 2\" did not disappoint.\n\nEven though it is still in early access, and there is no technical 'end' of the game, I've already gotten more enjoyment out of this than the original.\n\nIf you liked the original, give this a try.  It keeps to the original concept, yet perfectly expands it to organically take in the third dimension.", "timestamp_created": 1559339724, "timestamp_updated": 1559339724, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}]}